# Cursor Rule: Model Training Phase Reporting

Whenever executing a major model training session on the OPI project:
1. Always preserve an out-of-sample holdout test partition (e.g. data/ipo_holdout_test.csv). Do not train on 100% of data.
2. After training, document the iteration in `phases/Phase <N>/` following sequential numbering (Phase 1, Phase 2, etc.).
3. Each phase folder must contain:
   - `1_planning_and_goals.md`: Scope and objectives.
   - `2_building_and_execution.md`: Full build steps and executed commands.
   - `3_outcome_and_verdict.md`: Holdout evaluation metrics, comparisons vs GMP and mean baselines, verdict and review.
